notes: V035 reviews and hardens the V034 persistent MJPEG workflow for lower latency and stronger recovery. Connect remains control-only with zero image transfer. Start Stream still applies complete PC-owned OV2640 settings before /start, but the backend now uses a direct HTTPConnection stream with TCP keepalive, a Content-Length-aware multipart parser, newest-frame backlog dropping, event-driven browser preview wakeups, exponential reconnect backoff, and automatic ESP session recovery after a camera reboot or lost session. The matching ESP firmware adds TCP_NODELAY, HTTP server keepalive/send timeouts, a single low-latency stream client state, combined multipart header writes, and less disruptive Wi-Fi reconnect handling. Simulation still suspends image transfer and resumes it afterward. V024 / 0_2_4 remains the owner-confirmed passed baseline until explicit owner acceptance changes it. Physical/public-road traffic control remains disabled.
